   "content": "**South Sudan has the lowest upper secondary completion rate: just 2.1% (2025).** 13 of the 15 lowest rates are in sub-Saharan Africa:\n\n- **South Sudan:** 2.1% (2025)\n- **Niger:** 4.9% (2025)\n- **Central African Republic:** 5.6% (2025)\n- **Chad:** 6.6% (2025)\n- **Zimbabwe:** 8.1% (2025)\n\nThe map shows every country's latest rate; hover a country for its figure. These are UIS modelled estimates, and blank countries have no recent estimate. Source: UIS, November 2026 release; indicator CR.MOD.3.",
